{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bd400566d59d7a41b039a6067ed2aa0b19ce8728c17d4f9ba2c09dddb154dd15",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf08eff49ab821005c70202146c0b5ec78fd96ef80abdbe3e04e8f7e57724c97",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。现在方便吗？\n稍微有点话想跟你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:291d20cb63484fa810f92ad1a464e16d777fb0b6bf43f68ad537027c6780cb82",
      "text": "演出彩排结束的时候，\n你不是跟我说过“这样下去不行”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7582f7fde5f2f35b7a1b28175d4df2e83218eed7f1aa91ab05b778157000bc85",
      "text": "我觉得那不像\n冬马先生的风格",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:297f8c8a25189aae5f4ccb44b804c875404d2fed7f7bce6e21b6f2a8a68b4796",
      "text": "其实那个时候，我光是应付\n练习时记住的东西就已经拼尽全力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfc25facadb058649e7d35eedf376dc06b282bef5d4f9ea56fafc3ff29ab4caa",
      "text": "但是，被制作人一说，\n我猛然清醒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2d83356d7d58cc33df8b8a17b2f4fdb3d1fe6fa8293f47a83ca24c1f840b75",
      "text": "要成为顶尖偶像，\n只是按部就班地完成可不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c956792d422d268cd3cdeb6b8aa9b033a01c9548ba15306adfd40e08069a6060",
      "text": "要是有100分的表演，\n就必须去超越它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aebbd42d5b8fa3c2546f1977c317188671e2a5c845c804dd77f97122464b3292",
      "text": "明明应该明白这个道理的，\n我却被不习惯的动作分散了注意力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aec395be24b5812a32157e8abbd80acec7e68088a4c283011e29021ff0f7d2cc",
      "text": "正式演出时的冬马先生，\n非常耀眼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195e50561a27092fbf129f87b042e7d09dba0de1d218ede2983b63588b30135b",
      "text": "我相信冬马先生\n一定能做到的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c0cdc0a7234ccdbac2b599294a9f8e46127b577db9c87c5be81f3d63cf198be",
      "text": "多亏了制作人\n一直注视着我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:551f797138c3845ac8868aab77f3500e8933830a254074cbe8ab792b25cdbeab",
      "text": "当我的视野变窄时，\n你总是会让我注意到。谢谢你啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_402_2_4_001_02_09_a:2_4_001_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a4f7e11293487387eb1d765c95a239c693029e87c2128787e8140669071f1b",
      "text": "今后也拜托你了。\n那就回头见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
